<recipe>
<title>Chicken rissoles</title>
<notes>This recipe is from mykidslickthebowl.com.</notes>
<serves>Makes about 20 small rissoles.</serves>
<prep>Preheat the oven to 200 deg C.</prep>

<ingredients>
<i><q>500 g</q><n>chicken mince</n></i>
<i><q>1/2 C</q><n>breadcrumbs</n></i>
<i><q>1/4 C</q><n>Parmesan cheese, grated</n></i>
<i><q>1/2 C</q><n>broccoli stalk, grated</n></i>
<i><q>1</q><n>egg</n></i>
<i><q>2 Tbs</q><n>olive oil</n></i>
<i><q>1/2 tsp</q><n>garlic powder</n></i>
</ingredients>

<method>
<s>Put all the ingredients into a bowl and mix well.</s>
<s>Form into balls using about 2 Tbs each.</s>
<s>Bake for 20 minutes or until cooked.</s>
</method>

</recipe>